         &lt;p style=&quot;text-indent:24.000000000000004pt;text-align:justify;mso-pagination:none;mso-csssas11-rule:exactly;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none&quot; class=&quot;wza&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000&quot;&gt;昨日，&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000&quot;&gt;北方地区风力&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000&quot;&gt;有所&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000&quot;&gt;减弱，&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000&quot;&gt;中东部&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000&quot;&gt;大部地区气温回升，&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000&quot;&gt;江西南部、浙江南部、福建大部、台湾岛中北部等地出现中&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000&quot;&gt;到&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000&quot;&gt;大雨，&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000&quot;&gt;台湾岛北部&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000&quot;&gt;局地&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000&quot;&gt;暴雨或&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000&quot;&gt;大暴雨；西藏东部、川西高原中部等地部分地区出现小到中雨或雨夹雪。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000&quot;&gt;预计&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000&quot;&gt;未来三天&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000&quot;&gt;，&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000&quot;&gt;南方大部地区降水逐渐减弱，西藏东部、川西高原北部及新疆北部、东北地区东部等地&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000&quot;&gt;仍&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000&quot;&gt;多雨雪天气&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000&quot;&gt;。此外，&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000&quot;&gt;预计&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000&quot;&gt;本周内，&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000&quot;&gt;中东部大部地区气温将&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000&quot;&gt;稳步&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000&quot;&gt;回升，华北、黄淮、江淮等地最高气温将回升至20℃以上，江南、华南等地&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000&quot;&gt;大部地区&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000&quot;&gt;最高气温将&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000&quot;&gt;超过&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000&quot;&gt;25℃&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000&quot;&gt;。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt; 
